    <preface>
      <p>Statute Update (A.C.T. Self-Government (Consequential Provisions) Regulations) Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 13, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to make various amendments of the statute law of the Commonwealth to enable the repeal of certain provisions of the <i>A.C.T. Self</i><i>-</i><i>Government (Consequential Provisions) Regulations</i>, and for related purposes</p>
